    "title": "Duffy, Hastings, Judd to host joint meeting Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Independent Newsmedia ,\n9 hours ago Surprise Vice Mayor Jack Hastings and City Councilmembers Patrick Duffy and Chris Judd are hosting their usual joint district meeting this week, this time at the Surprise Gateway Training Center, 13659 W. Cactus Road.\nIt's scheduled for 9 a.m. on Saturday, Oct. 4.\nDuffy and Hastings typically host the meetings for District 3 and 5 residents, respectively, on the second Saturday of the month.\nDistrict 3 covers southwest Surprise. District 5 is in the central part of Surprise, including City Center.\nJudd typically hosts solo meetings for residents in District 6 on the second Saturdays and third Wednesdays each month.\nDistrict 6 covers the southeast portion of Surprise.\nTo contact Duffy, call 623-222-1323.\nTo contact Hastings, call 623-222-1325.\nTo contact Judd, call 623-222-1326.",
